Z||000001||Patrick||04-20-99||04:07 PM||||<br>Well, I was pretty direct with you because what you were doing was VERY dangerous.<p>If that hum you hear stops after a few seconds when you turn off the engine, it's just the electric fuel pump. This is normal.<p>
